@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### List everything in the starter catalogue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/components

### Filter by planet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/components?planet=Mars

### Click a component / generate its story
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/explore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "componentId": "apollo-11-descent-stage",
  "audience": "students aged 10-15",
  "includeImages": true
}

### Ask a follow-up question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "componentId": "apollo-11-descent-stage",
  "question": "Why did the astronauts leave this stage on the Moon?",
  "audience": "students aged 10-15"
}

### Ask why Ingenuity stopped flying
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "componentId": "ingenuity-helicopter",
  "question": "Why did Ingenuity stop flying?"
}

### Search the NASA Image and Video Library
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nasa/images?query=apollo%2011%20lunar%20module
